&lt;p style="line-height: 1; text-align: left"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐ明朝&amp;apos;"&gt;1.課題の洗い出し&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
