&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;主な活動内容&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;・取締役選定&lt;/p&gt;
